" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="11" color="#B9C4D8" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC">带内节选 2028-07-22 →“Total: Australia, N. Z.”</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1000" top="668" width="528" height="16"><Container width="528" height="16" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="11" color="#B9C4D8" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC">2030-06-01 →“…n. China, Japan”；偏食行写的是可见区</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="688" width="1456" height="1"><Container width="1456" height="1" color="#22304F"/></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="700" width="1456" height="18"><Container width="1456" height="18" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">来源：NASA 21 世纪日食目录 224 行逐行解析（nasa-21cen-catalog.html）；食甚点经纬度、γ、类型、带宽、最长均为目录原值，坐标粒度 1°。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="719" width="1456" height="18"><Container width="1456" height="18" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">地域描述：NASA 2021–2030 十年表 nasa-solar-basics.html 的 22 行，按日期与目录连接；带内 5 行原文节选如上。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="738" width="1456" height="18"><Container width="1456" height="18" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">推算：分箱、卡方、纬度带交叉表、|γ| 分组符号一致率、经度带/包围盒计数由 derive_geo.py、derive_geo2.py 现场算出，存 research/geo.json、geo2.json。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="757" width="1456" height="18"><Container width="1456" height="18" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">限制：本图只画食甚点，不画食带；“食带是否穿过某地”不能由食甚点经纬度判断（2070-04-11 恰在 135°E 边界，量化 ±0.5° 可使其进出）。</Text></Container></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>